flowchart TD
    Alert[Prometheus / Datadog Alert] --> PagerDuty[PagerDuty Triggered]
    PagerDuty --> OnCall[On-Call SRE Notified]
    
    OnCall --> Acknowledge{Ack within 5m?}
    Acknowledge -- No --> Escalate[Escalate to Secondary SRE]
    Acknowledge -- Yes --> Assess[Assess Severity: P1 / P2 / P3]
    
    Assess --> IsSev1{Severity == P1?}
    IsSev1 -- Yes --> WarRoom[Open Incident War Room & Slack Channel]
    IsSev1 -- No --> ApplyRunbook[Execute Standard Runbook]
    
    WarRoom --> Mitigate[Implement Mitigation / Rollback]
    ApplyRunbook --> Mitigate
    
    Mitigate --> Verify{Metrics Healthy?}
    Verify -- No --> WarRoom
    Verify -- Yes --> Resolve[Resolve Incident]
    
    Resolve --> Postmortem[Schedule Blameless Postmortem]
